      "id": 477502,
      "username": "Omar-Abdullah",
      "name": "Omar Shaikh Al Zoor",
      "created_at": "2025-08-14T05:44:37.873Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Maybe you have not installed the custom app on the production site yet:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">bench --site production.local install-app custom-app-name\nbench --site production.local migrate\n</code></pre>\n<p>If the issue is just that the fixtures are not shown in your production site, then I think you just need to migrate the production.local site after you do the export-fixture command on your development site:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">bench --site development.local export-fixture\nbench --site production.local migrate\n</code></pre>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/df788c/{size}.png",
