      "name": "Akshay",
      "created_at": "2025-08-14T09:55:06.212Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Check if your app name is showing when you migrate the site.</p>\n<p>If <strong>yes</strong>, then execute the following commands:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">bench build\nbench update --patch\n</code></pre>\n<p>If <strong>not</strong>, it means your custom app is not installed properly.</p>",
