      "id": 477598,
      "username": "Omar-Abdullah",
      "name": "Omar Shaikh Al Zoor",
      "created_at": "2025-08-14T12:56:41.027Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Maybe the  <code>bench export-fixtures</code> command on the production site is overriding those on the app. Try re-install the app on your production server, then just install the app, and migrate the site. Do not do export-fixtures in the production server.</p>",
